<title>USA: USDA accepts DEIP dry milk bid to Latin America.</title>
<headline>USDA accepts DEIP dry milk bid to Latin America.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department said Monday it accepted a bid from M.E. Franks Inc to sell 34 tonnes of nonfat dry milk to buyers in Caribbean, Central and South American nations.</p>
<p>Bonus was $739 per tonne and delivery was set for January 6-March 31.</p>
<p>Remaining DEIP balance for the region was 47,625 tonnes.</p>
